---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="CNC Machining Capabilities" description="Explore Belaro Precision CNC machining and coordinated secondary process support for drawing-based OEM components.">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">OUR CAPABILITIES</span><h1>Machining capability.<br/><em>Production focus.</em></h1><p>CNC machining and coordinated secondary process support for components manufactured to your engineering drawings.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="container">
      <div class="service-row" id="milling"><div class="service-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567789884554-0b844b597180?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="CNC milling machine"/></div><div class="service-copy"><span class="eyebrow">01 / CNC MILLING</span><h2>Complex profiles.<br/><em>Controlled dimensions.</em></h2><p>3-axis, 3+2 positional and simultaneous 5-axis CNC milling for precision components used in industrial equipment and assemblies. Send your drawing so we can review feature access, material, tolerance and batch requirements.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Machined plates, brackets and housings</li><li>3-axis, 3+2 positional and simultaneous 5-axis configurations</li><li>Drawing-based production review</li><li>Material and finish confirmed per project</li></ul><div class="milling-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="/services/cnc-milling/">Explore CNC Milling <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-orange" href="/contact/?process=milling#rfq-form">Request a Milling Quote <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div>
      <div class="service-row service-row-reverse" id="turning"><div class="service-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581092160562-40aa08e78837?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Industrial machining work"/></div><div class="service-copy"><span class="eyebrow">02 / CNC TURNING</span><h2>Rotational parts.<br/><em>Made to drawing.</em></h2><p>Turning requirements can be reviewed for shafts, sleeves, bushings and other rotational components. Feasibility depends on dimensions, material, geometry and available process capability.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Shafts and turned components</li><li>Sleeves, spacers and bushings</li><li>Threads and turned features, subject to review</li><li>Inspection criteria agreed before production</li></ul><div class="turning-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="/services/cnc-turning/">Explore CNC Turning <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-orange" href="/contact/?process=turning#rfq-form">Request a Turning Quote <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div>
      <div class="secondary-panel" id="secondary-processes"><span class="eyebrow">03 / SECONDARY PROCESSES</span><h2>Beyond machining.<br/><em>One coordinated requirement.</em></h2><p>The manufacturing ecosystem across Dongguan and Shenzhen gives Belaro access to flexible supplier support for grinding, heat treatment, surface finishing and other secondary processes required by your drawing.</p><div class="secondary-tags"><span>Grinding</span><span>Heat Treatment</span><span>Surface Finishing</span></div><a class="button button-outline" href="/services/secondary-processes/">Explore Secondary Processes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      <div class="production-panel" id="production"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">04 / PRODUCTION SUPPORT</span><h2>Low-volume batches.<br/><em>Repeat-order mindset.</em></h2><p>Belaro is positioned for OEM component requirements where communication, drawing control and repeatability matter. Indicative batch quantities are around 20–500 pieces, subject to part complexity and production review.</p><a class="button button-white" href="/services/production/">Explore OEM production <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .milling-actions,.turning-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:12px;width:100%;max-width:540px}
  .secondary-panel{margin:90px 0;background:var(--soft);border-left:4px solid var(--orange);padding:55px 60px}.secondary-panel h2{font-size:44px;margin:18px 0}.secondary-panel h2 em{color:var(--orange);font-style:normal}.secondary-panel p{color:var(--muted);max-width:760px}.secondary-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:24px 0 30px}.secondary-tags span{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
  @media(max-width:700px){.secondary-panel{margin:70px 0;padding:38px 24px}.secondary-panel h2{font-size:35px}.milling-actions,.turning-actions{grid-template-columns:1fr}.milling-actions .button,.turning-actions .button{width:100%}}
</style>
